</ul><h1>Get You Through</h1><p>Here’s a comment from one of the other times we sold these things:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>So, two power banks which, allowing for wireless charging losses, will probably <em>just barely</em> bring a typical phone up from 10% to a full charge <em>once</em> before they need to be charged themselves. And that’s <em>if</em> they still have a full charge when they’re pulled out of the pocket or backpack or purse where they’ve sat, half forgotten.</p>
